Step 4 — Explain why this matters

Narration:

“Nothing here was malware. The bug is architectural.”

Point at:

Browser
↓
Trusted localhost
↓
Tool execution

Explain:

* Browser content became control input
* Local controller trusted localhost
* Tool execution happened without approval

